    {
      "idx": 0,
      "scene": 1,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "平静",
      "text": "阿木今年六岁。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "volume": "+0%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.15,
      "start": 0.15,
      "duration": 2.184,
      "end": 2.334
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "scene": 1,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "温柔",
      "text": "出发前，妈妈在他头盔内侧贴了一张全家福，又在床头贴了一张火箭贴纸，说：想家的时候，就看看它。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-1Hz",
        "volume": "-2%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 2.834,
      "duration": 12.192,
      "end": 15.026
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "scene": 1,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "孤单",
      "text": "太空站的夜晚很长，机器一直在嗡嗡地响。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-20%",
        "pitch": "-4Hz",
        "volume": "-8%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 15.526,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 20.926
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "scene": 1,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "孤单",
      "text": "阿木把玩具火箭抱在怀里，数舱壁上亮着的小绿灯：一、二、三……",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-20%",
        "pitch": "-4Hz",
        "volume": "-8%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.3,
      "start": 21.226,
      "duration": 8.304,
      "end": 29.53
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "scene": 2,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "惊奇",
      "text": "数到第六颗的时候，他听见有人轻轻敲窗户。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-1%",
        "pitch": "+7Hz",
        "volume": "+3%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.9,
      "start": 30.43,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 34.87
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "scene": 2,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "平静",
      "text": "不是敲门，是敲窗。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "volume": "+0%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 35.37,
      "duration": 2.712,
      "end": 38.082
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "scene": 2,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "想念",
      "text": "阿木转过头，舷窗外只有地球，蓝蓝的，上面缀着一片一片金色的灯。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-17%",
        "pitch": "-1Hz",
        "volume": "-4%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 38.582,
      "duration": 8.16,
      "end": 46.742
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "scene": 2,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "想念",
      "text": "他趴到玻璃上，鼻子压得扁扁的。他想，那些灯里，有一盏是妈妈留的。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-17%",
        "pitch": "-1Hz",
        "volume": "-4%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.3,
      "start": 47.042,
      "duration": 8.568,
      "end": 55.61
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "scene": 3,
      "speaker": "star",
      "speaker_name": "star",
      "emotion": "低语",
      "text": "你在找什么？",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-25%",
        "pitch": "+8Hz",
        "volume": "-18%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.9,
      "start": 56.51,
      "duration": 2.304,
      "end": 58.814
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "scene": 3,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "惊奇",
      "text": "一个细细的声音问。阿木吓了一跳。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-1%",
        "pitch": "+7Hz",
        "volume": "+3%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 59.314,
      "duration": 3.936,
      "end": 63.25
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "scene": 3,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "惊奇",
      "text": "窗外的黑暗里，飘着一颗很小很小的星星，亮得刚好能看清它歪着头。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-1%",
        "pitch": "+7Hz",
        "volume": "+3%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.3,
      "start": 63.55,
      "duration": 6.672,
      "end": 70.222
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "scene": 3,
      "speaker": "amu",
      "speaker_name": "amu",
      "emotion": "平静",
      "text": "我在找我家的灯。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-4%",
        "pitch": "+2Hz",
        "volume": "+0%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 70.722,
      "duration": 2.376,
      "end": 73.098
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "scene": 3,
      "speaker": "star",
      "speaker_name": "star",
      "emotion": "温柔",
      "text": "我很久没听人说过“家”了。你能讲讲吗？",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-20%",
        "pitch": "+9Hz",
        "volume": "-2%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 73.598,
      "duration": 5.256,
      "end": 78.854
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "scene": 4,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "温柔",
      "text": "阿木就讲了。讲楼下的面馆，讲妈妈端面时烫红的手，讲那只总在窗台上晒太阳的猫。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-1Hz",
        "volume": "-2%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.9,
      "start": 79.754,
      "duration": 10.632,
      "end": 90.386
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "scene": 4,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "惊奇",
      "text": "讲着讲着，星星越来越亮，亮到阿木不得不眯起眼睛。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-1%",
        "pitch": "+7Hz",
        "volume": "+3%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 90.886,
      "duration": 5.304,
      "end": 96.19
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "scene": 4,
      "speaker": "star",
      "speaker_name": "star",
      "emotion": "温暖",
      "text": "这个给你。想家的时候捏一捏，会有点暖。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-16%",
        "pitch": "+12Hz",
        "volume": "+0%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.5,
      "start": 96.69,
      "duration": 5.592,
      "end": 102.282
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "scene": 4,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "温暖",
      "text": "天亮前，星星落下一小捧金色的沙。阿木把沙装进玻璃瓶，取名叫：第六颗星。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "-14%",
        "pitch": "+2Hz",
        "volume": "+0%"
      },
      "gap_before": 0.2,
      "start": 102.482,
      "duration": 9.672,
      "end": 112.154
    }
